class="timestamp">11d</span><span class='author'>Andre Snellings</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="article-feed" class="col-b" data-behavior="author_overlay article_header_news_feed_item_meta article_legal_footer"><article class="article" data-id="49794361" data-behavior="story_scroll story_progress byline_lines iframe" data-src="/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/49794361/2027-nfl-draft-order-projections-first-round-picks"><div class="container"><div class="ad-slot ad-slot-instream ad-wrapper" data-slot-type="instream" data-slot-kvps="pos=instream"></div><header class="article-header"><h1>2027 NFL draft order projections for Round 1, top pick, more</h1></header><div class="article-body"><div class="article-meta"><div class="byline-wrap"><ul class="authors byline-authors"><li class="single-author mugshot-shown"><div class="author-img"><img src="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/i/columnists/espn_generic_m.jpg&h=80&w=80&scale=crop" alt="" width="40" height="40"></div><div class="author">ESPN staff<span class="timestamp ">Sep 28, 2026, 06:00 AM ET</span></div></li></ul><div class="byline-multiple-authors" style="display:none;">Multiple Authors</div></div></div><div class="content-reactions reactions-allowed " data-behavior="content_reactions" data-contentid="49794361" data-nowid="1-49794361" data-contentTitle="2027 NFL draft order projections for Round 1, top pick, more"><div class="content-reactions-popup-overlay"></div><div class="content-reactions_reactions-wrapper"><div class="share-button-wrapper"><button class="icon-button reactions-button reactions-hover-button share-button user-not-parsed" data-behavior="share_button" aria-label="Share"></button><div class="share-popup"><ul class="share-popup-list social-tracking-parent" data-id="49794361" data-name="2027 NFL draft order projections for Round 1, top pick, more" data-type="article"><li><a data-behavior="copy_link" data-social-tool="copy" href="#" data-social-type="content" class="share-popup-link icon-font-before icon-chain-solid-before reactions-copy-link copy-link" aria-label="Copy Link"><span class="copy-link-inner"><span class="copy-link-inner-text share__label"></span><span class="copy-link-success-icon"><img class="icon" src="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/i/content-reactions/check.png&h=80&w=80" alt="Copy Link" loading="lazy"></span></span></a></li><li><a data-social-tool="email" href="mailto:?subject=2027%20NFL%20draft%20order%20projections%20for%20Round%201,%20top%20pick,%20more&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.espn.com%2Fnfl%2Fdraft2027%2Fstory%2F_%2Fid%2F49794361%2F2027%2Dnfl%2Ddraft%2Dorder%2Dprojections%2Dfirst%2Dround%2Dpicks" data-social-type="content" class="share-popup-link icon-font-before icon-email-solid-before email social-clicks-email" aria-label="Email">Email</a></li><li><a data-social-tool="print" href="https://www.espn.com/espn/print?id=49794361" data-social-type="content" class="share-popup-link print icon-font-before icon-print-solid-before page-action" aria-label="Print">Print</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="content-reactions-extended-wrapper"><button class="icon-button reactions-button main-reactions-button reactions-hover-button"></button><button class="sr-only main-reactions-sr-only">Open Extended Reactions</button><div class="main-reactions-popup content-reactions-popup"></div></div></div><div class="content-reactions_count-wrapper"><button class="icon-button reactions-button reactions-count-button reactions-hover-button" data-native-bridge="true"></button><div class="reactions-count-popup content-reactions-popup"></div></div><div class="reactions-skeleton-loading"><div class="reactions-skeleton-left"><div class="reactions-skeleton-el share-skeleton"></div><div class="reactions-skeleton-el"></div></div><div class="reactions-skeleton-right"><div class="reactions-skeleton-el"></div></div></div></div><video1><p>The <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/news">2027 NFL draft</a> is still months away, but with the <a href="/nfl/schedule">2026 season</a> underway, we're starting to track pick order in Round 1. Which teams are in position to add <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/bestavailable">elite prospects</a> in the top 10 next April? What about the top five ... or even at No. 1?</p><p>What follows is not the current draft order based on records. It is a projection of what ESPN's <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/fpi">Football Power Index</a> thinks the order <em>ultimately</em> will be by the end of the season. Each week during the season, the FPI projects the draft order by simulating the remainder of the season 10,000 times. Game probabilities are based primarily on the model's team ratings and game locations. The draft order is determined by the records the model projects for each team after 17 games, as well as each team's average draft position across the simulations.</p><p>So where do things stand? Here are the full sortable projections, complete with each team's chances to pick in the top five, in the top 10 and at No. 1.</p><p align="center"><strong><a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft/news">See more on the NFL draft</a></strong></p><img src="https://a.espncdn.com/i/infographics/20170710_nfl_fpr/charts/_end_rule.png" width="100%"><p><strong>First-round picks that have been traded:</strong></p><ul><li><p>The <a data-clubhouse-guid="06cd3bcf-7a86-53d4-28e7-aa049dd36261" href="/nfl/team/_/name/gb/green-bay-packers">Green Bay Packers</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid="b0fc8fb7-9dbe-e574-9008-6f0ee7c6b234" href="/nfl/team/_/name/dal/dallas-cowboys">Dallas Cowboys</a> in the <a data-player-guid="19e0d5a6-9c4e-83d1-c9c2-5cfa322727f5" href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4361423/micah-parsons">Micah Parsons</a> <a href="/nfl/story/_/id/46098144/sources-micah-parsons-traded-packers-gets-record-contract">trade</a>.</li><li><p>The <a data-clubhouse-guid="582d14eb-da61-e505-cc40-d972a1b60ed1" href="/nfl/team/_/name/ind/indianapolis-colts">Indianapolis Colts</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid="732d3caf-b350-1e34-48c6-b7cebb4a0d88" href="/nfl/team/_/name/nyj/new-york-jets">New York Jets</a> in the <a data-player-guid="4a3e8bb3-8d6a-7208-dc0f-7cf148b34c1b" href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4427250/sauce-gardner">Sauce Gardner</a> <a href="/nfl/story/_/id/46847491/sources-jets-trade-sauce-gardner-colts-2-first-rounders">trade</a>.</li><li><p>The <a data-clubhouse-guid="2e1473b2-e269-fd7a-1137-c1edacb85986" href="/nfl/team/_/name/lar/los-angeles-rams">Los Angeles Rams</a>' selection was dealt to the <a data-clubhouse-guid="539babc5-e5fb-753b-8ae1-c15032a91ef4" href="/nfl/team/_/name/cle/cleveland-browns">Cleveland Browns</a> in the <a data-player-guid="031d8156-6271-ea30-409f-137309621805" href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3122132/myles-garrett">Myles Garrett</a> <a href="/nfl/story/_/id/48939456/sources-browns-rams-finalizing-myles-garrett-blockbuster-trade">trade</a>.</li><li><p>The better of Dallas' two selections (either its own pick or the Packers' original pick) was dealt to the Jets in the <a data-player-guid="b299da3f-168e-d279-dc79-8d7b0d926def" href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4040982/quinnen-williams">Quinnen Williams</a> <a href="/nfl/story/_/id/46848422/sources-jets-trade-quinnen-williams-cowboys">trade</a>.</li></ul><div id="vs_design-inline">
